This software, including but not limited to the source code, algorithmic architectures,
Bayesian Truth Engine, Groth16 zero-knowledge state-verification circuits, 3D anatomical
assets, coordinate mapping data, and diagnostic reasoning models, contains confidential
and proprietary trade secrets protected under:
   - The Patents Act, 1970 (Government of India)
   - The Copyright Act, 1957 (Government of India)
