   - International Intellectual Property Treaties (WIPO, Berne Convention, TRIPS)

2. LIMITED EVALUATION LICENSE:
Access to this repository is granted strictly and exclusively for technical evaluation,
statutory audit, and institutional procurement review for the:
   MPOnline Citizen Health & Digital Infrastructure Initiative
   (Portal: https://innovate.mponline.gov.in/notices)
   in conjunction with the Department of Public Health and Medical Education,
   Government of Madhya Pradesh, and the All India Institute of Ayurveda (AIIA).

3. STRICT PROHIBITIONS:
Under no circumstances may any portion of this repository, source code, data dictionaries,
3D anatomical models, or documentation be:
   a. Copied, cloned, mirrored, fork-distributed, or sub-licensed to third parties;
   b. Decompiled, reverse-engineered, or disassembled;
   c. Used for commercial deployment or integration without a formal bilateral
      technology transfer agreement;
   d. Used to train, fine-tune, or benchmark any external commercial machine-learning
      models, large language models (LLMs), or generative AI agents.

4. 3D ANATOMICAL ASSETS & TRADEMARK RESTRICTION:
All 3D anatomical mannequin meshes, physiological spatial coordinate mappings, and
Ayush Marma point locational datasets are protected proprietary assets. Unauthorized
extraction, reproduction, or re-hosting of these binary assets is strictly prohibited
and subject to immediate injunctive relief and civil/criminal statutory damages.

